      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "The avatar linked has a cyclic dependency chain in it's VRCConstraint transforms. This causes undefined behaviour, resulting in jittering in your case, and is not fully supported.\n\nThe cycle in your case is: TrailerHitch referenced by ROOT.001 referenced by hind.chest (via child source) referenced by Other Hand (1) referenced by Banking Control Transform (via child source) referenced by TrailerHitch (via child source called MomentumFlight).",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
