  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Heyo, there has been a series of updates recently that have been \"modulating\" a jitter in my avatar(s) when the user looks down. I think the culprit is a parent constraint that has a Source that has a Phys Bone on it (TrailerHitch, it has multiple Sources, the last one is to a transform with a Phys Bone script). :/ I haven't changed anything in this aspect of my rig for months, and this jitter has shown up, vanished (as various tweaks on VRC's end have happened), and... now it's back... :( it happens when the Phys Bone Source is set to 0, and should not be affecting anything at all.\n\nHere's an avatar that has the problem: avtr_c5387daa-81ba-46b5-9967-0196ed4309ce",
